#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_kv_dph.field_product_template__l10n_sk_kv_rc_goods
msgid ""
"Set on goods whose domestic supply is reverse-charged under § 69 ods. 12 "
"písm. f) to i). Oddiel A.2 of the kontrolný výkaz then reports, per invoice,"
" the commodity code (f, g) or the kind of goods (h, i), and the quantity "
"with its unit. Leave empty for everything else, including the other § 69 "
"ods. 12 supplies (scrap, construction work), for which A.2 carries only the "
"base."
msgstr ""

